<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">You're invited to volunteer with Parinaam 🌱</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{#if organizationName}}<strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> is partnering with Parinaam Foundation, and you{{else}}You{{/if}} are invited to join our volunteering programmes — workplace exposure visits, community reading sessions, infrastructure mentorship and day outings with the students and communities we serve.</p>
{{#if note}}<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#3d4744;">{{note}}</p>{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;"><a href="{{registerUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d96c3f,#bc5328);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;">Register as a volunteer</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5e6a62;font-size:13px;">Registration takes about five minutes. Once approved, you can browse and enroll in upcoming sessions.</p>
